xt-eng-navy-700","children":["“","What is this passage mostly about?","”"]}],["$","li","Which of the following would be the best title for this passage?",{"className":"rounded-lg bg-eng-navy-50 p-3 text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":["“","Which of the following would be the best title for this passage?","”"]}],["$","li","Which is the best summary of the passage?",{"className":"rounded-lg bg-eng-navy-50 p-3 text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":["“","Which is the best summary of the passage?","”"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"mb-2 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-eng-teal-700","children":"What to do"}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"space-y-2","children":[["$","li","State the main idea in your own words before reading the choices.",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-eng-teal-700","aria-hidden":"true","children":[1,"."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"State the main idea in your own words before reading the choices."}]]}],["$","li","Run the coverage test: the right answer covers the whole passage and nothing more.",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-eng-teal-700","aria-hidden":"true","children":[2,"."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Run the coverage test: the right answer covers the whole passage and nothing more."}]]}],["$","li","For a title question, remember that a title covers the passage the way a main idea does — it is not the catchiest option.",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-eng-teal-700","aria-hidden":"true","children":[3,"."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"For a title question, remember that a title covers the passage the way a main idea does — it is not the catchiest option."}]]}],"$L13"]